<!DOCTYPE qhelp SYSTEM "qhelp.dtd">
<qhelp>
  <overview>
    <p>
      This summary metric is an applicability witness for the native visual
      response detector.  It reports each production Android and browser
      visual handler with the number of successful response exits that the
      query can inspect.
    </p>
    <p>
      A missing handler row or a zero exit count is an evidence gap.  Fixture
      paths and source-file presence do not qualify as production coverage.
    </p>
  </overview>
</qhelp>
